    "Installed voices": {
      "localizations": {
        "hr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Instalirani glasovi"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Installed voices"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Installed voices appear in macOS alongside its built-in voices. For VoiceOver, choose the voice in VoiceOver Utility › Speech. For reading text aloud, choose it in System Settings › Accessibility › Read & Speak (Spoken Content on older systems) › System voice. A newly installed voice can take up to a minute to appear.": {
      "localizations": {
        "hr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Instalirani glasovi pojavljuju se u sustavu macOS uz njegove ugrađene glasove. Za VoiceOver odaberite glas u uslužnom programu VoiceOver › Govor. Za čitanje teksta naglas odaberite ga u Postavkama sustava › Pristupačnost › Čitanje i govorenje (na starijim sustavima: Pročitani sadržaj) › Glas sustava. Može proći do jedne minute prije nego što se novoinstalirani glas pojavi."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Installed voices appear in macOS alongside its built-in voices. For VoiceOver, choose the voice in VoiceOver Utility › Speech. For reading text aloud, choose it in System Settings › Accessibility › Read & Speak (Spoken Content on older systems) › System voice. A newly installed voice can take up to a minute to appear."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Installed voices appear in the system alongside its built-in voices. For VoiceOver, add the voice in Settings › Accessibility › VoiceOver › Speech › Add Rotor Voice. For Speak Screen and Speak Selection, choose it in Settings › Accessibility › Read & Speak › Speak Screen or Speak Selection. A newly installed voice can take up to a minute to appear.": {
      "localizations": {
        "hr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Instalirani glasovi pojavljuju se u sustavu uz njegove ugrađene glasove. Za VoiceOver dodajte glas u Postavkama › Pristupačnost › VoiceOver › Čitanje › Dodaj glas rotora. Za značajke Pročitaj zaslon i Pročitaj odabir odaberite ga u Postavkama › Pristupačnost › Čitanje i govorenje › Pročitaj zaslon ili Pročitaj odabir. Može proći do jedne minute prije nego što se novoinstalirani glas pojavi."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Installed voices appear in the system alongside its built-in voices. For VoiceOver, add the voice in Settings › Accessibility › VoiceOver › Speech › Add Rotor Voice. For Speak Screen and Speak Selection, choose it in Settings › Accessibility › Read & Speak › Speak Screen or Speak Selection. A newly installed voice can take up to a minute to appear."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Installed voices appear in the system alongside its built-in voices. For VoiceOver, choose the voice in Settings › Accessibility › VoiceOver › Speech. For reading the screen and selected text aloud, choose it in Settings › Accessibility › Spoken Content › Voices. A newly installed voice can take up to a minute to appear.": {
      "localizations": {
        "hr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Instalirani glasovi pojavljuju se u sustavu uz njegove ugrađene glasove. Za VoiceOver odaberite glas u Postavkama › Pristupačnost › VoiceOver › Čitanje. Za čitanje zaslona i odabranog teksta naglas odaberite ga u Postavkama › Pristupačnost › Izgovarani sadržaj › Glasovi. Može proći do jedne minute prije nego što se novoinstalirani glas pojavi."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Installed voices appear in the system alongside its built-in voices. For VoiceOver, choose the voice in Settings › Accessibility › VoiceOver › Speech. For reading the screen and selected text aloud, choose it in Settings › Accessibility › Spoken Content › Voices. A newly installed voice can take up to a minute to appear."
          }
        }
      }
    },
